                                                "sense_id": "6ee3846e-8510-393c-9d60-2d6748f6ec62",
                                                "text": "Eleven Cubans in a vintage Buick — three of them the original “truckonauts” who tried a similar intrepid journey last year aboard a battered Chevy pickup — were intercepted by the U.S. Coast Guard early Wednesday and now face a return trip to the communist island."
                                            }
                                        ]
